Overview
SAICO Word Guess ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application (Native Android).

Information We Collect
1. Account & Authentication Data
When you log in using Google Sign-In via Firebase Authentication and Google Credential Manager, we collect:

Email Address: Used for account authentication and verifying eligibility for university-restricted leaderboards (@sastra.ac.in).

Display Name: Derived from your Google account to represent you on public leaderboards.

2. Gameplay & Performance Data
Scores & Timestamps: We track cumulative scores, puzzle completion status, and time penalties/bonuses to update game progress and leaderboard standings.

3. Guest Mode Data
If you choose Guest Mode, no personally identifiable information (PII) is linked to an account or stored on our external databases. High scores in Guest Mode remain local to your device.

How We Use Your Data
Leaderboard Verification: We verify if your email domain ends with @sastra.ac.in to allow participation in official SASTRA University campus rankings.

Game State Synchronization: Scores and cumulative stats are stored securely in Firebase Realtime Database.

App Functionality: To fetch game puzzles dynamically from cloud sources with offline fallbacks.

Public Data Visibility & Privacy
Leaderboard Privacy: Your email address is never displayed publicly. Only your public Display Name and score are visible to other users on the leaderboard.

Data Sharing: We do not sell, rent, or trade user data to third parties. Data is processed exclusively via Google Cloud / Firebase services for core gameplay functionality.

Third-Party Services
Our app integrates the following Google Cloud and Firebase services governed by Google’s Privacy Policy:

Firebase Authentication & Google Credential Manager: For user authentication.

Firebase Realtime Database: For leaderboard management and gameplay score persistence.

Data Retention & Account Deletion
Retention: Authenticated user profile data and scores are retained as long as your account remains active.

Data Deletion: You may request account and data deletion at any time by contacting us via the email provided in the app’s Profile screen or by using the deletion mechanism inside the app settings.

